The '''Blazing Volcano''' is a Sub-[[Location]] at the center of the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. It's purpose is mainly for lava-fishing, as it contains many different sized lava pools. {{NPCSprite|Odger}} can be found here and he sells different fishing gears for the player to lava fish there.

{{ZoneText|Fish for rare loot and find epic secrets.|Watch out for the lava.}}

== Description ==
The '''Blazing Volcano''' can be found by going directly forward at spawn. There is a fortress like Entrance Gate at the base of the Volcano. [[#Geysers|Volcanic Geysers]] can be found around the {{Item|Lava}} at the bottom of the volcano.

=== Odger's Hut ===
{{Zone|Odger's Hut}} is located in the top of the Volcano. It is an obsidian house with a netherbrick roof. To access it, the player must step on the pressure plate, to open the iron door.

=== Magma Chamber ===
Around the Lava Pool at the bottom of the Volcano will be an opening on the lava surface which leads to the {{Zone|Magma Chamber}}.

== Mechanics ==
=== Geysers ===
1 Geyser is located in the Blazing Volcano. {{Item|Steaming-Hot Flounder}}s can be caught when fishing within 2 blocks of the Geyser. Every 10 minutes, the Geyser's location will change to one of the following locations:
* {{Coords|-397|118|-772}}
* {{Coords|-390|118|-754}}
* {{Coords|-386|118|-795}}
* {{Coords|-377|118|-767}}
* {{Coords|-365|118|-761}}
* {{Coords|-360|118|-782}}
* {{Coords|-357|118|-797}}
* {{Coords|-344|118|-786}}
* {{Coords|-349|118|-766}}

=== Volcanic Eruption ===
Approximately every 2-2.5 hours, the lava pool at the bottom will rise, until it completely fills the volcano, when it will start spewing out blocks. If players touch the risen lava without {{PotionName|Obsidian Skin}}, they die. They have different chances to be spewed out.<br>
