Wherever the {{Item|Sponge}} lands, it will turn into {{Item|Sulphur Ore}}, which can be mined with a tool with {{stat|bp|8}} or above. Wherever a {{Item|Block of Coal}} lands, it will turn into a {{MobSprite|Matcho}}.

