This system functions similarly to the way the old explosion in the {{zone|Blazing Fortress}} worked, and similarly can be viewed in the tab list.

When the volcano isn't erupting, it will be displayed as {{Volcano Activity|Inactive}}.
===== Usage =====
Chance to spawn a {{Corrupted}} mob is increased to {{Green|5%}} during a '''Volcanic Eruption'''.

When the Volcano is erupting, {{Item|Sulphur Ore}} and {{MobSprite|Matcho}} will spawn around the island. Furthermore, if the eruption is {{Volcano Activity|Cataclysmic}} and the player has clicked the bookshelf located on {{coordinates|10|127|-938}} with at least {{stat|int|4000}}, they can — for the duration of the eruption — go near {{zone|Magma Chamber}} and mine a block at {{coordinates|-373|82|-880}}, with any drill, granting them the {{Item|Kuudra Relic}}.

If the player has a full set of {{Item|Kuudra Follower Armor}} they can, during a {{Volcano Activity|Cataclysmic}} eruption, speak to {{NPCSprite|Drakuu}} and purchase {{Item|Kuudra Follower Artifact}}.

